  BASE                     77/77.
  M30/M31/M32/M33/M28r/M37 MUST NOW DIE.  These are the six pass-2 escapes; if any still scores
                           77/77 the closure has failed on its own motivating case.
  M34/M35/M36              must still die (no row broke).
